Scope of this license
=====================

This MIT license applies to the R package source code, the
manifest-generation scripts in data-raw/, the machine-readable
metadata files in inst/extdata/, and the documentation files
(README.md, VALIDATION.md, CITATION.cff,
inst/CITATION, validation/README.md).

It does not change the licensing terms of:

- The research data deposited in EMBL-EBI BioStudies under
  accession S-BSST3199. That record is governed by its own
  BioStudies deposit terms.

- The Harvard Dataverse record at DOI 10.7910/DVN/SR2HBR
  (metrics-petri 3.0.0 software archive). That record is licensed
  under the MIT license independently; the license grant there
  is separate from the license grant here.

- The Harvard Dataverse record at DOI 10.7910/DVN/7BJLIQ
  (U-Net validation dataset). That record is also licensed under
  the MIT license independently.

- The grayleafspotr analysis software. That package is governed
  by its own license (see its DESCRIPTION / LICENSE file).

The R package grayleafspotdata does not relicense any of the
above. Researchers using the underlying research files remain
bound by the terms of the original deposits.

A plain-text copy of the MIT license text is also shipped as the
LICENSE file at the repository root.
